* The full-screen toolkit, shared base: the menu bar of a page, made from the page's key table (S.88 phase 5, F0a; plan section 2.2 and the owner's decisions of 29 Oct 2026).
* Copyright (c) 2026, SD Core for Linux.  This program is free software; you can redistribute
